	(gr_text "Seen from the front; the F side faces the display glass.\nOutline = the shell wall measured near its rim, 0.3 mm inside it.\nThe display module PCB sits here: a custom board of this outline replaces it or stacks behind it.\nThe four bosses take M3 screws (2.8-3 mm printed pilots).\nDwgs.User shows the shell cut 0.5 mm behind the plane where the display PCB sits; the GPS hood is\nabove the top edge."
